§ `The 2026 figures agree with cpf-contributions.l4`

-- cpf-wages-year.l4 repeats the 2026 employee figures of cpf-contributions.l4 so that one function answers both years. These
-- assertions tie the two together for the five bands: an age whose band, in a month of 2026 with no birthday in it, is 0 to 4.

`age 50 in August 2026` MEANS `My month of work` WITH
    `my residence status` IS `a citizen of Singapore`
    `my age in completed years` IS 50
    `my birthday falls in this month` IS FALSE
    `the year` IS 2026
    `the month` IS 8
    `my ordinary wages for the month` IS 4000
    `I have additional wages this month` IS FALSE
    `my employer is a body in First Schedule paragraph 6, or I am a public-sector employee under paragraph 7` IS FALSE
    `my Schedule class` IS `none of the Schedule classes`
    `I am a domestic employee` IS FALSE
    `paragraph 4(2) of the Order is met for my domestic contract` IS FALSE
    `my domestic work did not exceed 14 hours in any 7 consecutive days of this month` IS FALSE
    `paragraph 5 of the Order covers me as a seaman` IS FALSE

